        "y0": 0.5796085128686741,
        "x1": 0.9234318659855769,
        "y1": 0.5917413353463242
      },
      "text": "small sample sizes. Therefore, we investigated the incidences,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07862666203425481,
        "y0": 0.5942847786583054,
        "x1": 0.3373677049946581,
        "y1": 0.6064176011359554
      },
      "text": "without involvement of side branches.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "picture",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.19145299145299147,
        "y0": 0.4275638585194165,
        "x1": 0.8068376068376069,
        "y1": 0.6050862084555595
      },
      "text": "[Image: Im0]",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3374023959168002,
        "y0": 0.5953409912333483,
        "x1": 0.3421036679520566,
        "y1": 0.6023658957061183
      },
      "text": "1",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.3421035897018563,
        "y0": 0.5942733199508101,
        "x1": 0.4785950228699252,
        "y1": 0.6064061424284602
      },
      "text": "In the era of drug-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196574414897169,
        "y0": 0.5943013431164192,
        "x1": 0.9286431206597222,
        "y1": 0.6064341655940693
      },
      "text": "predictors, and clinical outcomes of acute and late stent",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0786369128104968,
        "y0": 0.6089661501985553,
        "x1": 0.4843762520032051,
        "y1": 0.6210989726762053
      },
      "text": "eluting stents (DESs), late-acquired stent malapposition is a",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196574414897169,
        "y0": 0.6089941733641643,
        "x1": 0.9240326188568376,
        "y1": 0.6211269958418144
      },
      "text": "malapposition detected by OCT in a large number of patients",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0786369128104968,
        "y0": 0.6236589804463003,
        "x1": 0.4821667271801549,
        "y1": 0.6357918029239504
      },
      "text": "well-recognized problem in interventional cardiology because",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196574414897169,
        "y0": 0.6236870036119093,
        "x1": 0.6511472001034989,
        "y1": 0.6358198260895593
      },
      "text": "who received DESs.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0786369128104968,
        "y0": 0.6383518106940453,
        "x1": 0.4786275749532585,
        "y1": 0.6504846331716954
      },
      "text": "it may constitute a potent substrate for late stent thrombo-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.0786369128104968,
        "y0": 0.6530446409417904,
        "x1": 0.09984546237521702,
        "y1": 0.6651774634194405
      },
      "text": "sis.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09984068259214744,
        "y0": 0.654089394809338,
        "x1": 0.11394452478131677,
        "y1": 0.6611142992821081
      },
      "text": "1–3",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.11394461607321715,
        "y0": 0.6530217235268,
        "x1": 0.4830804938943977,
        "y1": 0.66515454600445
      },
      "text": "The incidence of late-acquired stent malapposition was",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6830748468382746,
        "y0": 0.6536602931308868,
        "x1": 0.7562423836471688,
        "y1": 0.6683473940248843
      },
      "text": "Methods",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07864034277761084,
        "y0": 0.6677145732621428,
        "x1": 0.4786471766284388,
        "y1": 0.6798473957397928
      },
      "text": "reported to be as high as 25% in patients with acute myocar-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07864032973591079,
        "y0": 0.6824074229974857,
        "x1": 0.1756377652160123,
        "y1": 0.6945402454751357
      },
      "text": "dial infarction.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.17562274117755075,
        "y0": 0.6834635965973329,
        "x1": 0.18032402625450722,
        "y1": 0.690488501070103
      },
      "text": "4",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18032410450470754,
        "y0": 0.6823959058271971,
        "x1": 0.48427537445329194,
        "y1": 0.6945287283048471
      },
      "text": "In addition, predictors of late-acquired stent",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.6753716401822418,
        "x1": 0.652460707966079,
        "y1": 0.6887816018680655
      },
      "text": "Study Population",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.6919744498884998,
        "x1": 0.9252897344083868,
        "y1": 0.7028301331579762
      },
      "text": "Patients who received implantation of DESs for de novo coronary",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07863350240593282,
        "y0": 0.6970887555625399,
        "x1": 0.47862413846529445,
        "y1": 0.70922157804019
      },
      "text": "malapposition include plaque or thrombus absorption or posi-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.7041111114229126,
        "x1": 0.9228778545673076,
        "y1": 0.714966794692389
      },
      "text": "lesions between January 2009 and December 2011 with poststent and",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07863350240593282,
        "y0": 0.7117816052978827,
        "x1": 0.24385199261526777,
        "y1": 0.7239144277755328
      },
      "text": "tive vascular remodeling.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.24385503785223023,
        "y0": 0.7128377983853278,
        "x1": 0.2626601781600561,
        "y1": 0.7198627028580978
      },
      "text": "1,5,6",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2626601781600561,
        "y0": 0.711770107615192,
        "x1": 0.48351424779647434,
        "y1": 0.723902930092842
      },
      "text": "Intravascular ultrasound (IVUS)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.7162477729573256,
        "x1": 0.9226147252270299,
        "y1": 0.727103456226802
      },
      "text": "follow-up OCT were identified from the OCT registry database of our",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07863624768379407,
        "y0": 0.7264629573505348,
        "x1": 0.4848302727071648,
        "y1": 0.7385957798281848
      },
      "text": "imaging was used to detect stent malapposition in previous",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.7283844344917385,
        "x1": 0.9242726904714209,
        "y1": 0.7392401177612149
      },
      "text": "institute. Exclusion criteria included the following (1) the DES was",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07863624768379407,
        "y0": 0.7411558070858777,
        "x1": 0.48301147721771504,
        "y1": 0.7532886295635277
      },
      "text": "studies. IVUS may not completely detect stent malapposition",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.7405210960261515,
        "x1": 0.9236769456129807,
        "y1": 0.7513767792956279
      },
      "text": "implanted for left main coronary disease, (2) there were overlapping",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07863624768379407,
        "y0": 0.7558486568212205,
        "x1": 0.4786755814511552,
        "y1": 0.7679814792988705
      },
      "text": "because of limited axial resolution (100–200 μm) or stent-",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.7526577575605643,
        "x1": 0.9239239032451924,
        "y1": 0.7635134408300407
      },
      "text": "DESs implanted in the lesion, (3) the clinical follow-up period after",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.18794495672242253,
        "y0": 0.7715862019613176,
        "x1": 0.192646241799379,
        "y1": 0.7786111064340877
      },
      "text": "5",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.7647944190949773,
        "x1": 0.922847180488782,
        "y1": 0.7756501023644536
      },
      "text": "DES implantation was <1 year, (4) follow-up OCT was performed >1",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07863624768379407,
        "y0": 0.7705415065565633,
        "x1": 0.18794307871761484,
        "y1": 0.7826743290342133
      },
      "text": "related artifacts.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.19264632004957932,
        "y0": 0.7705185111911818,
        "x1": 0.4875360603006477,
        "y1": 0.7826513336688319
      },
      "text": "However, optical coherence tomography",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.7769310806293902,
        "x1": 0.9226581280048077,
        "y1": 0.7877867638988665
      },
      "text": "year after DES implantation, and (5) the OCT image had poor quality.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07863007895966881,
        "y0": 0.7852113609265245,
        "x1": 0.4833794487847222,
        "y1": 0.7973441834041747
      },
      "text": "(OCT) with a higher resolution (12–18 μm) may detect stent",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.789067742163803,
        "x1": 0.9233863765357906,
        "y1": 0.7999234254332794
      },
      "text": "Ultimately, 351 patients with 356 lesions were enrolled in this study.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07863007895966881,
        "y0": 0.7999042106618675,
        "x1": 0.4847916562333066,
        "y1": 0.8120370331395175
      },
      "text": "malapposition with greater accuracy. There are limited data",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5196581196581197,
        "y0": 0.801204403698216,
        "x1": 0.9224870209001068,
        "y1": 0.8120600869676924
      },
      "text": "During the same study period, there were 3235 patients (3587 lesions)",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09230769230769231,
        "y0": 0.8416347381864623,
        "x1": 0.4054700802534055,
        "y1": 0.8518518518518519
      },
      "text": "Received August 20, 2013; accepted December 15, 2013.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09230769230769231,
        "y0": 0.8531289910600255,
        "x1": 0.9249899839743589,
        "y1": 0.8633461047254151
      },
      "text": "From the Division of Cardiology, Severance Cardiovascular  Hospital (E.I., B.-K.K., Y.-G.K., D.-H.S., J.-S.K., D.C., Y.J., M.-K.H.) and Severance",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.07863247863247863,
        "y0": 0.8646232439335888,
        "x1": 0.6224957849225428,
        "y1": 0.8748403575989783
      },
      "text": "Biomedical Science Institute (Y.J., M.-K.H.), Yonsei University College of Medicine, Seoul, Korea.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.09230769230769231,
